    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><br>The Achero 410 space station, a high-value government base, has always been a prime target for rival nations.\u2028The Pentest puts you in the role of an agent of a private company in charge of the security audit of the station. In order to test the base's defense system, as well as its mysterious administrator, you will have to use all the resources and tricks at your disposal in this first-person puzzle game:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Analyze the security systems<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638670/extras/953f6b414a639758b6620c69aec3dde1.avif?t=1671179015\" /></div><br><br></li><li>Hack into the station's protected infrastructure<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638670/extras/6d2f6d4c4c948755ff4f9737bb757b6d.poster.avif?t=1671179015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638670/extras/6d2f6d4c4c948755ff4f9737bb757b6d.webm?t=1671179015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638670/extras/6d2f6d4c4c948755ff4f9737bb757b6d.mp4?t=1671179015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Play with gravity<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638670/extras/c5805f60ed695d44c61c8a763b6a26b2.poster.avif?t=1671179015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638670/extras/c5805f60ed695d44c61c8a763b6a26b2.webm?t=1671179015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1638670/extras/c5805f60ed695d44c61c8a763b6a26b2